Model publication changes
-------------------------
The publisher's NInfer v2 container is converted to v3 once, before publication,
using the pinned Cinference runtime's standard-library Python upgrader. Original
tensor payload bytes are preserved and the maintained Qwen3.8 chat template is
installed. The recipe downloads the resulting artifact directly.

The published provenance.json records input/output identity and checksums,
conversion-tool provenance, and the statement of changes. The original
Barding-Defense conversion report is retained separately under source/.

